OL,3,GNEWSABuddhist monk thanks community
OL,4,Aafter attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Buddhist monk injured by two youths
OL,7,Fduring an attack along a riverside has
OL,8,Fthanked the local community for their
OL,9,F"immense kindness".
OL,11,FKarucha Sripramote said he had been
OL,12,Fpunched and kicked after being
OL,13,Frepeatedly harassed by masked children
OL,14,Fin Hebburn Riverside Park, South
OL,15,FTyneside, on Tuesday.
OL,17,FWriting on social media, Sripramote
OL,18,Fadded he holds "no anger" towards the
OL,19,Fchildren involved.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
