OL,3,GNEWSABuddhist monk thanks community
OL,4,Aafter attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he was "deeply touched by the
OL,7,Foutpouring of support" and warm
OL,8,Fmessages from people in Hebburn where
OL,9,Fhe has lived for more than six years.
